      <h1 class="support-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>This policy explains how Kidz Quest handles information submitted through this registration service. The service is intended for parents or guardians registering a child.</p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>Registration collects a child's name, age and gender, and a parent or guardian's name and phone number. We also maintain registration, attendance, check-in and pickup-code information. If text messaging is used, we may maintain messaging consent and opt-out choices, message content, delivery status and related records. Our servers may also collect technical request information.</p>

      <h2>How we use and share information</h2>
      <p>We use this information to register children, manage attendance and pickup, contact guardians, and operate the service. If you opt in, we may send registration codes, pickup reminders and messages from staff. Service providers, including hosting and messaging providers such as Twilio, may process information to provide these services. Information may also be disclosed when required by law.</p>
      <p>Kidz Quest does not sell or share SMS opt-in data or consent with third parties for their marketing purposes. Messaging providers process information as needed to deliver messages.</p>

      <h2>Registration suggestions</h2>
      <p>The registration page currently makes some existing registration information, including guardian contact details, available to visitors through its child-name suggestions. Please consider this when providing information. Contact Kidz Quest staff if you have questions or concerns.</p>

      <h2>Text message choices</h2>
      <p>Text messages are optional. Reply STOP to a Kidz Quest text to opt out or HELP for help. Message frequency varies; message and data rates may apply. See our <a href="/terms">Terms &amp; Conditions</a> for more information.</p>

      <h2>Retention and requests</h2>
      <p>Registration and messaging records may be retained for event administration and related operational needs. To ask about access, correction or deletion of your or your child's information, speak with Kidz Quest event staff. We may need to verify your identity and consider applicable retention requirements before responding.</p>

      <h2>Contact and changes</h2>
      <p>For questions about this policy or our information practices, speak with Kidz Quest event staff. We may update this policy as our practices change; the current version will be posted on this page.</p>
